# requirements.in — Direct (top-level) dependencies only.
#
# WHY requirements.in exists:
#   requirements.txt pins EVERY package including transitive dependencies.
#   This file lists only what YOU directly depend on — cleaner, human-readable.
#
# HOW to generate requirements.txt from this file:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile requirements.in --output-file=requirements.txt
#
# HOW to update all packages to latest compatible versions:
#   pip-compile --upgrade requirements.in

